$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 desc_overview {
  coords 6331.32 213.304 6425.825
  m_sTitle "Overview"
  m_sTextData "SOBR forces assault a diesel power plant occupied by an armed group."
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
 }
 desc_sobr {
  coords 6331.32 213.304 6425.825
  m_sTitle "Briefing"
  m_sTextData "<h2>Situation</h2>"\
  "Earlier today, enraged by a recent political development in your country, an extremist group took up arms and occupied a local power plant."\
  ""\
  "Threatening destruction of the power plants expensive diesel generators, the group made several demands including political changes, however the authorities are of course unwilling to make such concessions."\
  ""\
  "You are part of an anti-terror force that recently arrived in Luzohrad. Unfortunately, the enemy has become aware of your presense and as threatened, sabotaged the generators, which is likely to result in catastrophic damage if they keep running for more than 20 minutes."\
  ""\
  "There are likely no more than 6 enemies, they were seen with various small arms."\
  ""\
  "<h2>Mission</h2>"\
  "Assault the power plant and eliminate the terrorists."\
  "If possible, also prevent destruction of the generators by safely shutting them down within 20 minutes."\
  ""\
  "<h2>Service Support</h2>"\
  "There are some wirecutters on a table near the start location, they can be used to cut the fence surrounding the power plant."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
 }
 desc_extr {
  coords 6331.32 213.304 6425.825
  m_sTitle "Briefing"
  m_sTextData "<h2>Situation</h2>"\
  ""\
  "You part of an extremist political group. Enraged by a recent development in your country, you have taken up arms and occupied"\
  "the local power plant."\
  ""\
  "Countrary to your expectations, threatening destruction of the expensive diesel generators and demanding political changes seems to not have worked out as planned: A couple hours after police isolated the larger area, a local informant reported the arrival of an anti-terror force in Luzohrad."\
  "It is likely that they will attempt to take the power plant by force."\
  ""\
  "As threatened, you just initiated destruction of the generators by sabotaging them, however they will likely still last about 20 minutes before catastrophic failure can be expected."\
  ""\
  "<h2>Mission</h2>"\
  ""\
  "Defend the power plant from the attacking force."\
  "At least, try to delay the attackers so they are unable to interrupt destruction of the generators."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_SEPARATIST"
  }
 }
 desc_notes {
  coords 6331.32 213.304 6425.825
  m_sTitle "Notes"
  m_sTextData "End conditions:"\
  "- Major SOBR Victory: Generators shut down within 20 minutes, all enemies killed"\
  "- Minor SOBR Victory: All enemies killed, but generators were destroyed"\
  "- Extremist Victory: 85% SOBR casualies"\
  ""\
  "Restrictions:"\
  "- 90 second setup timer restricting SOBR"\
  "- Defenders are restricted to AO marked on map (power plant complex)"\
  ""\
  "Other:"\
  "- The generators are in the north eastern building."\
  "- SOBR can shut the generators down using an interaction that appears when looking at the dials of the <b>first</b> generator."\
  "- When in doubt about sightlines, use the LOS tool."
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
 }
}